# Environment / secrets
# NOTE: .env holds only browser-public Lovable Cloud values (URL + publishable
# key) and MUST stay tracked, or production builds ship without them and the
# app renders a blank screen. Never add server secrets to it.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
